  "description": "ZIMVIC crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C82 H70 Br10 Eu4 N24 O16 S4,18(C2 H6 O1 S1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 5 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.725-4.187 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.33-127.49°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C110H154N24O30S18Br10Eu4.",
